      "turn": 1,
      "content": "This is a Provider template, not a Maker. Preserve all settings and preview two independent taker sales of 0.0001 WETH and 0.001 WETH using explicit hypothetical allocations of 0.01 WETH / 25 USDC. Explain Maker direction and differences without asking for a real wallet or claiming launch readiness.",
